  "partnerRating": "NotApplicable",
  "description": "<p>Located in the heart of the Netherlands, Wittenborg University of Applied Sciences is a vocational university recognised by the Dutch government. It was founded in 1987 and provides higher-level bachelor's and master's degrees in vocational education.</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p><ul><li>With its main campus located in Apeldoorn, Wittenborg University of Applied Sciences is a vibrant business school that holds dual accreditation</li><li>It has more than 1500 students and staff representing over 100 nationalities</li><li>It is one of the few higher education institutions in the Netherlands that speaks only English</li><li>The University also maintains a bustling study centre in Amsterdam where you can concentrate on technology and entrepreneurship</li></ul><p><strong>Why choose Wittenborg University of Applied Sciences?</strong></p><ul><li>The University accepts students from more than 180 countries and is acknowledged as the most international institution in the Netherlands.</li><li>You’ll be a part of a varied and welcoming community that values cross-cultural dialogue and international viewpoints.</li><li>Working together with peers from diverse backgrounds can help you develop your cross-cultural communication abilities and prepare you for an increasingly globalised work world.</li><li>The University prioritises hands-on learning and real-world experiences.</li><li>The degree programs offered by the institution are made to bridge the knowledge and skill gap between theory and practice, giving you the tools needed to excel in the workplace.</li><li>Internships, case studies, and projects with actual businesses will provide you with practical experience and a thorough grasp of how real-world businesses operate.</li><li>The University is proud to offer a customised learning environment. Experienced faculty members provide you with individualised attention and support because of the small class sizes and student-centred approach.</li></ul>",
